<TD VALIGN="top"><B>ADSs on issue</B></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">Approximately 32.8&nbsp;million before the change; approximately 1.64&nbsp;million after the change.</TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="font-size:1pt">
<TD HEIGHT="8"></TD>
<TD HEIGHT="8" COLSPAN="2"></TD></TR>
